{"version":1,"content":"<p>中國載人航天工程副總設計師王翔今日（31日）透露，中國計劃在2030年前實現中國人登陸月球，將採用「兩次發射，一次登月」的方式實現。</p><p>乘組計劃由三人組成，其中兩人着陸月球表面。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:12.757466+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T06:01:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.062851+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.062851+00:00","content_hash":"1bda595fde913fb28779ab33707550d4296b7fd241cb7c852711713847b55816","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}